"""Magneto-Electro-Optical Transport integrated control V3.

This file is deliberately self-contained.  It does not import Camera_lv.py or
Camera_lv_sub_2410.py, LED_control.py, Motor_control.py or Thorlabs_control.py,
so it can be copied and run by itself on the Windows control computer.  The
original programs remain independent.

Recovered LED serial protocol:
    COM5, 115200 baud, 8-N-1, no flow control
    commands end with CR; query responses end with LF

Recovered magnet links:
    out-of-plane COM14 BOP + COM13 Gauss meter
    in-plane COM12 BOP + COM15 Gauss meter
    115200 baud, 8-N-1; commands end with CR and replies through LF
"""

